# The citation metadata of stokesjx (Citation File Format 1.2.0). GitHub shows it as
# "Cite this repository", and docs/citation.qmd repeats it. The version must equal the
# version of pyproject.toml, and tests/test_docs_site.py checks that.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use stokesjx, please cite the software and the method papers below."
title: "stokesjx"
abstract: >-
  Instantaneous viscous response of a spherically symmetric mantle to internal loads
  (geoid, dynamic topography, surface velocity), in JAX, with derivatives.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ghelichkhan
    given-names: Sia
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1316-3170"
    website: "https://sia-g.com"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/g-adopt/stokesjx"
url: "https://gadopt.org/stokesjx/"
keywords:
  - geophysics
  - geoid
  - dynamic topography
  - mantle flow
  - propagator matrix
  - JAX
references:
